cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and acknowledge MovieLens separately."
type: software
title: "Diversity- and Popularity-Bias-Aware Movie Recommender"
authors:
  - family-names: Ghadimi
    given-names: Parsa
repository-code: "https://github.com/pArsA-Gh38/bias-aware-movie-recommender"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An undergraduate research prototype comparing Popularity, ItemKNN and implicit
  ALS with genre-diversity and popularity-novelty reranking under a global
  temporal evaluation protocol. The project includes a FastAPI backend,
  Next.js frontend and a shared deterministic inference package.
